# Tool editor UX & sitewide face uplift

Companion to [`responsive-layouts.mdc`](responsive-layouts.mdc) (shell tiers), [`public-marketing-ux.mdc`](public-marketing-ux.mdc) (Home / marketing), and [`comms-public-ux.mdc`](comms-public-ux.mdc) (workshop language, Brand Kit CTAs, Related tools, `purposeHint`, export success). This rule owns **editor chrome**, **face uplift**, and the **public-page register**.

Re-touch is allowed when a surface is still marked “done” but fails the 375 / 768 / 1280 / 1536 check — update the register below after shipping.

## Hard rule: no tag-only refactors

Reject changes that only swap `py-12` → `py-8 md:py-12` without changing composition. Spot-check **375 / 768 / 1280 / 1536** — each must look intentional (columns, measure, CTA wrap, no page-level horizontal scroll).

**Marketing / Home:** empty space at `lg+` requires a **composition** change (secondary visual zone, grid, or constrained band) — padding-only still fails. See [`public-marketing-ux.mdc`](public-marketing-ux.mdc).

## Layout contracts

| Kind | Contract |
|------|----------|
| Canvas tools | [`ToolEditorLayout`](src/components/tools/ToolEditorLayout.tsx): H1 via `PUBLIC_PAGE_TITLE_CLASS`; subtitle/purposeHint `max-w-prose` + `leading-relaxed`; **shared form panel** (`border-opseu-blue/15`, `p-4 md:p-6` gradient surface) wraps `form` — do **not** nest a second `Card` as the form root; sticky preview `lg:sticky lg:top-4`; mobile Edit + **opaque sticky mini dock** → full Preview pane; tabs ≥44px; **all canvas tools pass `previewActions`** for export on full Preview |
| Dual preview | `preview` + `previewSecondary` (board-banner); mini dock shows primary only |
| Galleries | `belowGrid` (resizer all-formats) |
| Sources | `footer` slot — not a sibling ad-hoc PageShell |
| Non-canvas tools | densify only; no fake Edit/Preview |
| Guides | `GuideLayout` + [`guide-ui`](src/components/comms/guide-ui.ts); fluid titles via `PUBLIC_*` tokens; chapter body per [`guide-layout-standards.mdc`](guide-layout-standards.mdc) |
| Focus prose | `PageShell focus` (manifesto, auth, install) — not multi-panel workspaces |
| Brand Kit / Display settings | `PageShell` **wide** + [`PublicHubPanel`](src/components/comms/PublicHubPanel.tsx) for bordered workspace forms (not GuideLayout) |
| Guide index | `GuideLayout preset="hub"`; child guides stay narrow/playbook as appropriate |
| Hub nested forms | `PageShell nestedFocus` / `nestedAuth` (no double `px`) |
| Hub / Portal dashboards | Fluid `PUBLIC_PAGE_TITLE_CLASS` / section titles; responsive widget grids — not GuideLayout |
| Header | `<lg` drawer; `lg+` Guides/Tools dropdowns (keep groups — see `comms-public-nav.mdc`) |
| Footer | wrap/stack; tap targets ≥44px |
| Auth | centered `max-w-md`; dense form; calm shell |
| Hub chrome | HubNav drawer under `lg` (same as public Header); Officer tools flyout viewport-clamped; list pages dense; table scroll inside wrappers only |

## Face-uplift checklist (every page)

1. **Hierarchy** — one H1; section labels `text-sm font-medium text-gray-700`
2. **Controls** — `SegControl` for pill groups (`min-h-11`); selects share Input border/`min-h-11`
3. **Density** — Prefer ToolEditorLayout form panel (or `PublicHubPanel`) over nested Cards; form `space-y-3`–`space-y-5`; tool padding `py-6 md:py-8 lg:py-10`. Card `density="compact"` remains for Hub/Portal widgets.
4. **Touch** — primary actions and tabs ≥44×44; icon-only → aria-label (or title)
5. **Focus** — `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-opseu-blue/40`
6. **Preview chrome** — screen `p-4 md:p-6` (not export `p-10`); sticky while editing; mobile mini dock is opaque (`bg-white/95`) under header, fixed `h-24` centered scale; full preview ≤~70vh
7. **Brand** — Brand Kit colours where chrome shows brand; no new OPSEU hex in core UI; canvas exports use `resolveCanvasTokens` + shared primitives when chrome fits ([`comms-visual-system.mdc`](comms-visual-system.mdc))
8. **A11y** — radiogroup/`aria-checked` or `aria-pressed`; UndoRedoBar uses i18n `editHistory`
9. **Overflow** — no page horizontal scroll at 375
10. **Empty surfaces** — no orphan Cards; prefer Callout for short notes

## Shared primitives

- [`ToolEditorLayout`](src/components/tools/ToolEditorLayout.tsx) — owns H1 + form panel chrome
- [`PublicHubPanel`](src/components/comms/PublicHubPanel.tsx) — Brand Kit / onboarding / Display settings surfaces
- [`PUBLIC_PAGE_TITLE_CLASS` / `PUBLIC_SECTION_TITLE_CLASS` / `PUBLIC_CARD_TITLE_CLASS`](src/lib/constants/public-type.ts)
- [`ToolFormDetails`](src/components/tools/ToolFormDetails.tsx) — collapse secondary Options / Colours / Advanced; keep primary copy + layout visible
- [`ToolColourSection`](src/components/tools/ToolColourSection.tsx) — ThemePicker + ContrastChecker inside Colours collapse (ThemePicker tools)
- [`ToolExportActions`](src/components/tools/ToolExportActions.tsx) — PNG/PDF/ZIP row for form + `previewActions`
- [`MobilePreviewStage`](src/components/tools/MobilePreviewStage.tsx) — mobile mini (fixed viewport, centered) / full scale-to-fit; desktop passthrough
- [`SegControl`](src/components/tools/SegControl.tsx)
- Card `density="compact"` | `"default"` (`p-4 md:p-5` / `p-4 md:p-6`) — Hub widgets & bespoke exceptions (alt-text, rules-of-order), not canvas form roots
- Capture: `data-export-root` only on printable canvas; preview guides use `data-export-chrome` + [`stripExportChromeFromClone`](src/lib/export/capture.ts)

## Shell checklist (every canvas tool)

Before marking a canvas tool done, confirm:

1. `purposeHint` (`whenToUse` i18n)
2. `exportError` + `exportSuccess` from `useExportHandler`
3. `previewActions` on full Preview (export reachable on mobile Preview tab)
4. `BrandSetupPrompt` merged into **`toolbar`** (never a second `toolbar=` / not buried only in the form body)
5. `ToolRelatedFooter` / `RELATED_BY_TOOL` entry
6. Colours collapsed via `ToolColourSection` or `ToolFormDetails` when the tool has colour overrides
7. **Form IA order:** content fields first → `ToolFormDetails` **`sectionLayout`** (layout, format/size, logo mode + show local number) → `sectionOptions` toggles → `sectionColours` → typography/QR/photo advanced blocks → undo/export

